# ============================================================================
# 1. GOOGLE AI STUDIO SECRETS PANEL (Android App BuildConfig)
# ============================================================================
# Set COOLIFY_BACKEND_URL in the AI Studio "Secrets" (Key icon) panel before building/exporting your APK.
# It gets baked into BuildConfig so NO user ever has to type the server URL manually:
# COOLIFY_BACKEND_URL=https://vidyakosha.yourdomain.com
#
# Keep GEMINI_API_KEY commented out if users bring their own AI keys in-app so APK sharing stays unrestricted.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY

# ============================================================================
# 2. COOLIFY ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES / SECRETS PANEL (PostgreSQL + Backend API)
# ============================================================================
# Configure these in Coolify -> Your Project -> Service -> "Environment Variables":
# POSTGRES_USER=vidyakosha
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your_strong_postgres_password
# POSTGRES_DB=vidyakosha
# DEFAULT_ADMIN_PASSWORD=test1234
